{"unit_id":"Napstablooky233__dsh-agent-dispatch#card-zh","repo":"Napstablooky233/dsh-agent-dispatch","commit":"d7273319a11a5402976d9519e420110e81ccc87a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-dispatch 是 DSH 网页端的帮手调度插件，在设置面板中管理主 agent 可使用的派活模式、协作通道和模型名册。它把当前策略注入 systemPrompt，并提供配置保存、恢复默认和名册重新扫描。名册可合并宿主已注册模型、兄弟插件状态与手动条目；适合希望为任务配置子代理或多帮手协作方式的 DSH 用户。插件本身不要求 API 密钥，配置保存在本地 DSH 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:174-203","index.js:274-346","client.js:21-32"]}
{"unit_id":"Napstablooky233__dsh-agent-dispatch#card-en","repo":"Napstablooky233/dsh-agent-dispatch","commit":"d7273319a11a5402976d9519e420110e81ccc87a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-dispatch is a DSH web plugin for configuring dispatch modes, helper channels, and models. It combines host and sibling-plugin models with manual entries, then injects policy into systemPrompt. Users can save settings or rescan the roster. Configuration is local; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:174-203","index.js:274-346","client.js:21-32"]}
